<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Skoda says has record output in 1996.</title>
<headline>Czech Skoda says has record output in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Skoda Auto a.s., majority-owned by Volkswagen AG, saw its 1996 production rise 26.3 percent, year-on-year, to a record 263,193 units, a company spokesman told Reuters on Monday.</p>
